{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0024","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":25,"subject":"math","topic_key":"functions","total_weight":85,"expected_output":"screening-0024.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0541","source_sha256":"5fba5ff3387fd285035171a0506eeaf8518d66dc6f62e127eefd84112e4d5165","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f$ به صورت مقابل است. دامنه تابع $\\frac{f(x)}{f(x - 2)}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0541/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.4435}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$[2, 4] - \\{3\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[2, 4)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(2, 4]$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[0, 4] - \\{1, 3\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اشتراک دامنه توابع $f$ و $g$ مجموعه $\\{-1, 2\\}$ است.\n$(\\frac{f+g}{g-f})(1) = \\frac{f(1)+g(1)}{g(1)-f(1)} = \\frac{4-2}{-2-4} = -\\frac{1}{3}$\n$(\\frac{f+g}{g-f})(-2) = \\frac{f(-2)+g(-2)}{g(-2)-f(-2)} = \\frac{1+3}{3-1} = 2$\n$\\Rightarrow (-\\frac{1}{3})(2) = -\\frac{2}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0541/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0541/stem_1.webp","sha256":"82d4e123d21c3e16464de93b1b9c85a2ee3d6b9b85bbe936f57d32a26f4f68b8","bytes":4740}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":541,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0542","source_sha256":"8afea9c7f6eba57b35b1a601b7c82f049d14dde96ee5c18a051bdb81a8c2082c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر نمودار تابع $f(x)$ به صورت مقابل باشد، برد تابع $y = \\frac{f(x)}{x}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0542/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.4435}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$(-\\infty, 1)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, 1)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(1, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\mathbb{R} - \\{1\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اشتراک دامنه توابع $f$ و $g$ مجموعه $\\{-1, -2, 2\\}$ است.\n$(f-\\frac{f}{g})(2) = f(2)-\\frac{f(2)}{g(2)} = 3-\\frac{3}{-40} = 3+\\frac{3}{40} = \\frac{123}{40}$\n$(f-\\frac{f}{g})(-1) = f(-1)-\\frac{f(-1)}{g(-1)} = 2-\\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{8}{5}$\n$(f-\\frac{f}{g})(-2) = f(-2)-\\frac{f(-2)}{g(-2)} = -1-\\frac{-1}{-8} = -\\frac{7}{8}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0542/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0542/stem_1.webp","sha256":"25b225673da27fb2a0b55ff360768c4cbd078ca681f543b50d9471cd6cc60a1b","bytes":3140}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":542,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0543","source_sha256":"8db9afd21aea414f15eac463c72454693eb3e4f5a2fc6faa4eb0030603b94642","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر شکل مقابل نمودار تابع $f$ باشد، دامنه تابع $\\frac{1}{f(x) - x}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0543/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.6731}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$[0, 4] - \\{2\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[0, 4] - \\{1, 3\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, 4) - \\{1\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, 4) - \\{2\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با فرض آن که اعضای دامنه تابع $f$ عضو دامنه $g$ نیز باشند خواهیم داشت:\n$(f-2g)(1) = 3\\times 1 + 2 = 5 \\Rightarrow f(1)-2g(1)=5$\n$\\Rightarrow 0-2g(1)=5 \\Rightarrow g(1)=-\\frac{5}{2}$\n$(f-2g)(2) = 3\\times 2 + 2 = 8 \\Rightarrow f(2)-2g(2)=8$\n$\\Rightarrow -1-2g(2)=8 \\Rightarrow g(2)=-\\frac{9}{2}$\n$(f-2g)(3) = 3\\times 3 + 2 = 11 \\Rightarrow f(3)-2g(3)=11$\n$\\Rightarrow 1-2g(3)=11 \\Rightarrow g(3)=-5$\n$(f-2g)(4) = 3\\times 4 + 2 = 14 \\Rightarrow f(4)-2g(4)=14$\n$\\Rightarrow 2-2g(4)=14 \\Rightarrow g(4)=-6$\nدقت داشته باشید لازم نیست همه زوج مرتب‌های $(\\frac{5}{2}, -1)$، $(-\\frac{9}{2}, 2)$، $(-5, 3)$ و $(-6, 4)$ در $g$ وجود داشته باشد. هم‌چنین $g$ می‌تواند دارای زوج مرتب‌هایی با xهای غیرمشترک با اعضای دامنه $f$ باشد."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0543/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0543/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f6754c87d6bb7e46b6f4c5f819500ca37d66327fbe6024810c127c961bc53484","bytes":3488}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":543,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0544","source_sha256":"e773d51adbd1a7b35e958f6f962044b65a6503adbd253ed4beda834d49264914","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f(x) = x^2$ و نمودار تابع $g(x)$ به صورت مقابل باشد، برد تابع $\\frac{f}{g}$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0544/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.6731}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[0, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(-\\infty, 0)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(-\\infty, 0]$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع درجه‌دوم $g$ را به صورت $g(x)=ax^2+bx+c$ نمایش می‌دهیم. تابع $f+g$ همانی است؛ بنابراین:\n$(f+g)(2)=2 \\Rightarrow f(2)+g(2)=2 \\Rightarrow -1+g(2)=2$\n$\\Rightarrow g(2)=3 \\Rightarrow 4a+2b+c=3$ (۱)\n$(f+g)(-1)=-1 \\Rightarrow f(-1)+g(-1)=-1$\n$\\Rightarrow -7+g(-1)=-1 \\Rightarrow g(-1)=6 \\Rightarrow a-b+c=6$ (۲)\n$(f+g)(3)=3 \\Rightarrow f(3)+g(3)=3 \\Rightarrow -3+g(3)=3$\n$\\Rightarrow g(3)=6 \\Rightarrow 9a+3b+c=6$ (۳)\n$(1)-(2) \\Rightarrow 3a+3b=-3 \\Rightarrow a+b=-1$\n$(3)-(2) \\Rightarrow 8a+4b=0 \\Rightarrow 2a+b=0$\n$\\Rightarrow a=1, b=-2 \\Rightarrow c=3$\nدر نتیجه:\n$g(x)=x^2-2x+3 \\Rightarrow g(-2)=4+4+3=11$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0544/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0544/stem_1.webp","sha256":"cb93194d18c18ffbca46d9785517f1f6e19853dab35eac416becb9e1bebcc21b","bytes":4616}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":544,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0545","source_sha256":"1a0a5efd190ca0bf902505a0cb8b4a4beaa07134cf6665bcd81d5817356dce78","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در تابع خطی $g$ و تابع $f$ که نمودار آن به صورت مقابل است، داریم $(f+g)(2) = 1$ و $(f-g)(1) = 4$. مقدار $(f \\times g)(-1)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0545/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.5263}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"۳"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۴"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۶"}],[{"type":"text","text":"۸"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ضابطه توابع خطی $f$ و $g$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$f(x) = ax+b \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} f(2) = 0 \\Rightarrow 2a+b=0 \\\\ f(0) = -4 \\Rightarrow b=-4 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow a=2$\n$\\Rightarrow f(x) = 2x-4$\n$g(x) = a'x+b' \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} g(-4) = 0 \\Rightarrow -4a'+b'=0 \\\\ g(0) = -4 \\Rightarrow b'=-4 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow a'=-1 \\Rightarrow g(x) = -x-4$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$\\Rightarrow f+g=fg \\Rightarrow (2x-4)+(-x-4) = (2x-4)(-x-4)$\n$\\Rightarrow 2x^2+5x-24=0 \\Rightarrow \\alpha\\beta = \\frac{c}{a} = \\frac{-24}{2} = -12$\nمی‌توانستیم با استفاده از شیب خطوط و عرض از مبدأ، معادلات $f$ و $g$ را به دست آوریم."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0545/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0545/stem_1.webp","sha256":"f33a3dee8dcf6d47a6449b567a95863528b2d5ebee5624019ee14c9c8959c8be","bytes":4774}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":545,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0546","source_sha256":"0b418dc8f979b8b77a415f3daab393702ea2aac611911a7387d0634f98cecc5f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f$ به صورت مقابل است. نمودار تابع $f(x) - f(x - 1)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0546/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":7.3846}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۱"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۳"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۴"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دامنه تابع $fg$ بازه $[-k, k]$ و برد آن بازه $[0, 9]$ است:\n$f(x) = \\sqrt{k+x} \\quad g(x) = \\sqrt{k-x}$\n$0 \\le fg \\le 9 \\Rightarrow 0 \\le \\sqrt{k^2-x^2} \\le 9$\nاز طرفی:\n$\\begin{cases} 0 \\le k^2-x^2 \\le 81 \\\\ 0 \\le k^2-x^2 \\le k^2 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow k^2=81$\nبا توجه به دامنه $fg$ که بازه $[-k, k]$ است درمی‌یابیم $k$ مثبت بوده و در نتیجه $k=9$ می‌باشد.\nبنابراین:\n$\\frac{f}{g} = \\frac{\\sqrt{9+x}}{\\sqrt{9-x}} \\Rightarrow D=[-9, 9) \\xrightarrow{x \\in \\mathbb{Z}} x \\in \\{-9, -8, \\dots, 8\\}$\nدامنه شامل ۱۸ عدد صحیح است."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0546/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0546/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2bbe790feab883257b588b47f214cbd6ba7674cccf02b374739625e054bf688f","bytes":84}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":546,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0547","source_sha256":"dd704b418c89ac4e9261b1e1bbb50ae467df322c5f4e886f4807f2442ac4d166","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f$ به صورت مقابل است. نمودار تابع $f(x+1) - f(x-1)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۱"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۲"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۳"}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۴"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $f+g$ در بازه $[0, 2]$ به صورت مقابل است."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0547/solution_1.webp","alt":"نمودار تابع f+g","aspect_ratio":1.8986}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0547/solution_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0547/solution_1.webp","sha256":"4a90ce369489e2e1d818e2ae0600c48a3de8de93806f28ef027a9ccc1be7858b","bytes":2558}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":547,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":30,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0548","source_sha256":"8a51ad57005f5c98b029306eb8889bcf2ef3400b3c7b529551ca2fba479d3e4d","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار توابع $y_1 = 3x - f(x)$ و $y_2 = x + \\frac{1}{2} g(x)$ به صورت مقابل است. ضابطه $f + g$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0548/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.0104}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-2x$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-x - 2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-x$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2x - 2$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار خطی $y_1$ از نقاط $(0,-2)$ و $(1,0)$ عبور می‌کند، بنابراین ضابطه آن به صورت $y_1 = 2x - 2$ است. نمودار خطی $y_2$ بر $y_1$ عمود بوده و از $(0,-2)$ می‌گذرد در نتیجه شیب خط $y_2$ برابر $-\\frac{1}{2}$ و عرض از مبدأ آن $-2$ است:\n$y_2 = -\\frac{1}{2}x - 2$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$y_1 = 3x - f(x) = 2x - 2 \\Rightarrow f(x) = x + 2$\n$y_2 = x + \\frac{1}{2}g(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}x - 2 \\Rightarrow g(x) = -3x - 4$\n$\\Rightarrow (f+g)(x) = -2x - 2$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0548/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0548/stem_1.webp","sha256":"7387aed68ea7f8c62ddf2a55d963822dc2e6d044dfdaec5b337b80de949ece74","bytes":6752}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":548,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0549","source_sha256":"b4724f9f217548a95222b862115d8cfd893d9b67038269e01673e124ed47ca9a","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار توابع $f$ و $g$، مساحت ناحیه محدود به نمودار $f - g$ و $y = 4$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":0.8653}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{4}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار توابع $f$ و $g$ ضابطه آن‌ها را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$f(x) = \\begin{cases} -2x+1 & x < 0 \\\\ 1 & x \\ge 0 \\end{cases} \\quad g(x) = \\begin{cases} -2 & x < 0 \\\\ \\frac{x}{2}-2 & x \\ge 0 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow (f-g)(x) = \\begin{cases} -2x+3 & x < 0 \\\\ -\\frac{x}{2}+3 & x \\ge 0 \\end{cases}$\nبا توجه به شکل مساحت محدود به نمودار $f-g$ و خط $y=4$ برابر است با:\n$S = \\frac{5 \\times 1}{2} = \\frac{5}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/solution_2.webp","alt":"نمودار f-g و مساحت محدود","aspect_ratio":2.6544}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/solution_2.webp","sha256":"cd87ab7ca34523751313dc93928f3205f93bd4e04259a3221906ac84452d5058","bytes":8110},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0549/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a2028e998fe5c0ffb25d93da26157bb6ec6b3e56a1bc7438608e1d26676ba8c3","bytes":6374}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":549,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0550","source_sha256":"27cab6d51bd3fca29a6c6a2b0d37bc4cf1cf7cf861a8854ca0e057be66e2fc45","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع $y = 2x - f(x - 1)$ به صورت مقابل است. نمودار تابع $y = x + f(-x)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":0.7232}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۱"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_1_2.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.1613}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۲"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_2_3.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.1613}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۳"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_3_4.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":0.8421}],[{"type":"text","text":"شکل ۴"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_4_5.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":0.8438}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به شکل ضابطه $y=2x - f(x-1)$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$y = 2x - f(x-1) = \\begin{cases} x+2 & -4 \\le x < 2 \\\\ 4 & x \\ge 2 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow f(x-1) = \\begin{cases} x-2 & -4 \\le x < 2 \\\\ 2x-4 & x \\ge 2 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow f(x) = \\begin{cases} x-1 & -5 \\le x < 1 \\\\ 2x-2 & x \\ge 1 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow f(-x) = \\begin{cases} -x-1 & -1 < x \\le 5 \\\\ -2x-2 & x \\le -1 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow y = x + f(-x) = \\begin{cases} -1 & -1 < x \\le 5 \\\\ -x-2 & x \\le -1 \\end{cases}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/solution_6.webp","alt":"نمودار y = x + f(-x)","aspect_ratio":3.4762}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"358b7ce1ee9adb38d19f1c109da58b2ac392884602871e22eecb0693bcf64aad","bytes":3020},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"4462ca612ab2d8b94f6568ecd95ca05f9b4988f1bbcb19a6704baf95d035abc3","bytes":2738},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"770032305a1457681e20bfa9076542a7f0f091d415d147630ac8e7f039e4a8ae","bytes":23134},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"26749e59ff58bc5e098533863b332410587e7e8902c743eca577ef12020860b2","bytes":23580},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/solution_6.webp","sha256":"384565416f8619c0d571cefc5d24ac9faafbb035186c78894fb30b53f7c8584b","bytes":3696},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0550/stem_1.webp","sha256":"4fc0b81b9ae4e53f9d50ec2c8d7d7d4b0441c9ee43958fe693aa72af8d23aadd","bytes":3620}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":550,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0551","source_sha256":"9c6045c74279355a5d8aa7352c7b803964ee5a5bc79d1e10a66cab8c7811580c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار تابع خطی $f$ و سهمی $g$ به صورت مقابل است. نمودار تابع $f - g$ از کدام ناحیه عبور نمی‌کند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.6893}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"اول"}],[{"type":"text","text":"دوم"}],[{"type":"text","text":"سوم"}],[{"type":"text","text":"چهارم"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع خطی $f$ از نقاط $(4,0)$ و $(2,4)$ عبور کرده و ضابطه آن $f(x) = -2x+8$ است. سهمی $g$ دارای صفرهای $4$ و صفر بوده و رأس آن $(2,4)$ می‌باشد.\n$g(x) = a(x-2)^2 + 4 \\xrightarrow{g(0)=0} 4a+4=0 \\Rightarrow a=-1$\n$\\Rightarrow g(x) = -(x-2)^2 + 4 = -x^2+4x$\nبنابراین:\n$f-g = (-2x+8) - (-x^2+4x) = x^2 - 6x + 8$\n$= (x-2)(x-4)$\nنمودار $f-g$ از ناحیه سوم عبور نمی‌کند."},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/solution_2.webp","alt":"نمودار f-g","aspect_ratio":1.9204}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/solution_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/solution_2.webp","sha256":"98962aba79c4e33ab6ed9b9acc828bd00c1dc5d4a42c91dd07e57343bce072b6","bytes":7282},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0551/stem_1.webp","sha256":"76a14849303c5b51934d09fcbce20c9b21ef514c4b3b89290559e813ebc916af","bytes":6534}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":551,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0552","source_sha256":"edbc94f52e2f300b7b59ec614045d25fff706442648319b6c07f0b111c7ab3bb","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f(x) = \\log(x^2 + 2x - 8)$ و $g(x) = \\sqrt{x^2 - 4} + 2$ باشد، دامنه تابع $\\frac{f}{g}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$(2, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(-\\infty, -4)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\mathbb{R} - [-4, 2]$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\mathbb{R} - (-4, 2)$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دامنه $\\frac{f}{g}$ به صورت زیر است:\n$D_{\\frac{f}{g}} = \\{ x \\mid x \\in D_f \\cap D_g , g(x) \\neq 0 \\}$\n$f(x) = \\log(x^2+2x-8) \\Rightarrow x^2+2x-8 > 0$\n$\\Rightarrow (x+4)(x-2) > 0$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} x < -4 \\\\ x > 2 \\end{cases} \\Rightarrow D_f = (-\\infty, -4) \\cup (2, +\\infty)$\n$g(x) = \\sqrt{x^2-4} + 2 \\Rightarrow x^2-4 \\ge 0 \\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} x \\ge 2 \\\\ x \\le -2 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow D_g = (-\\infty, -2] \\cup [2, +\\infty)$\nبنابراین:\n$D_{\\frac{f}{g}} = D_f \\cap D_g = (-\\infty, -4) \\cup (2, +\\infty) = \\mathbb{R} - [-4, 2]$\nمعادله $g(x) = 0$ ریشه ندارد."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":552,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0553","source_sha256":"3653ecc6a47827164de69c2ba2c7c3f0bc68add69470cb0284f24cf24a361e37","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"هرگاه $f = \\{(1, 2), (2, 1), (3, 2), (4, 1)\\}$ به طوری که $g(x) = f(x + 1)$ و $h(x) = f(x) + 1$، برد تابع $g + h$ چند عضو دارد؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$3$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به تابع $f = \\{(1,2), (2,1), (3,2), (4,1)\\}$ توابع $g(x)=f(x+1)$ و $h(x)=f(x)+1$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$g = \\{(0,2), (1,1), (2,2), (3,1)\\}$\n$h = \\{(1,3), (2,2), (3,3), (4,2)\\}$\n$\\Rightarrow g+h = \\{(1,4), (2,4), (3,4)\\} \\Rightarrow R_{g+h} = \\{4\\}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":553,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0554","source_sha256":"16b8fe4c10c63e23f43fd4006fd873cf9aef962112da58ffd02ba6ab996b5283","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع ثابت $f$، $g$ تابع همانی و $2g(4) = f(1)$ است. حاصل $\\frac{(f \\circ g)(0)}{(f + g)(2)}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$0/6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$0/8$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$1/2$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع ثابت $f(x)=k$ و تابع همانی $g(x)=x$ مفروض‌اند.\n$f(1) = 2g(4) \\Rightarrow k = 2 \\times 4 = 8 \\Rightarrow f(x) = 8$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$\\frac{(f \\circ g)(0)}{(f+g)(2)} = \\frac{f(g(0))}{f(2)+g(2)} = \\frac{f(0)}{8+2} = \\frac{8}{10} = 0/8$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":554,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0555","source_sha256":"27fc4409531b02a39a8529889b708ea16631aef0b30aaabb4d524df11c40dd69","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(2, 3), (-2, 1), (0, 2)\\}$ و $g = \\{(3, 0), (0, 5), (-2, -1)\\}$، آنگاه $g \\circ (g - f)$ شامل کدام زوج مرتب است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$(-2, -1)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(-2, -2)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, 3)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(0, 2)$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $g-f$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$f = \\{(2,3), (-2,1), (0,2)\\} \\quad g = \\{(3,0), (0,5), (-2,-1)\\}$\n$\\Rightarrow g-f = \\{(0,3), (-2,-2)\\}$\nبنابراین:\n$x = 0 \\xrightarrow{g-f} 3 \\xrightarrow{g} 0 \\Rightarrow (0,0) \\in g \\circ (g-f)$\n$x = -2 \\xrightarrow{g-f} -2 \\xrightarrow{g} -1 \\Rightarrow (-2,-1) \\in g \\circ (g-f)$\n$g \\circ (g-f) = \\{(0,0), (-2,-1)\\}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":555,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0556","source_sha256":"1009275ec42888449f5bfc530332b990c92a0a40696722c8f29434c4476a707f","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(2, 3), (3, 0), (1, 4), (-1, 2)\\}$ باشد، مجموع اعضای برد تابع $\\frac{f \\circ f}{f}$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{1}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{7}{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا $f \\circ f$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$f = \\{(2,3), (3,0), (1,4), (-1,2)\\}$\n$\\Rightarrow f \\circ f = \\{(2,0), (-1,3)\\}$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$\\frac{f \\circ f}{f} = \\{(2,0), (-1, \\frac{3}{2})\\} \\Rightarrow R = \\{0, \\frac{3}{2}\\}$\nمجموع اعضای برد:\n$0 + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{3}{2}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":556,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0557","source_sha256":"1fa2099d363d249958a4e72295b3c5fe984f8ea442be08d99781d0094a896040","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f(x) = x^2 - x$ و $g(x) = \\sqrt{4x + 1}$ باشد، دامنه تابع $f \\circ g$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$[-\\frac{1}{4}, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[-\\frac{1}{4}, 0) \\cup (0, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[\\frac{1}{4}, +\\infty)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$[-\\frac{1}{4}, 0]$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"$fog$ را تشکیل می‌دهیم.\n$f = \\{(1,-1), (2,4), (3,1)\\} \\qquad g(x) = \\frac{2x}{x+3}$\n$g(a) = 1 \\Rightarrow \\frac{2a}{a+3} = 1 \\Rightarrow a=3 \\Rightarrow (3,1) \\in g \\Rightarrow (3,-1) \\in fog$\n$g(b) = 2 \\Rightarrow \\frac{2b}{b+3} = 2 \\Rightarrow 6 = 0 \\text{ غ ق ق }$\n$g(c) = 3 \\Rightarrow \\frac{2c}{c+3} = 3 \\Rightarrow c = -9 \\Rightarrow (-9,3) \\in g \\Rightarrow (-9,1) \\in fog$\nبنابراین: $fog = \\{(3,-1), (-9,1)\\} \\Rightarrow R_{fog} = \\{-1,1\\}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":557,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":31,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0558","source_sha256":"011a64320ad83b6cce471f95d60b69815ccc4707da45497372ec61cbaef43368","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به ماشین‌های زیر، مقدار $y$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0558/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":12.0097}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$5$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$6$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$7$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع خطی $f(x) = ax+b$ دارای شیب مثبت است. ($a>0$)\n$(f-g)(x) = 4 \\Rightarrow g(x) = f(x) - 4 = ax+b-4$\n$fog(x) = 4x+1 \\Rightarrow f(ax+b-4) = 4x+1$\n$\\Rightarrow a(ax+b-4)+b=4x+1 \\Rightarrow a^2x+ab-4a+b=4x+1$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} a^2=4 \\xrightarrow{a>0} a=2 \\\\ ab-4a+b=1 \\Rightarrow 2b-8+b=1 \\Rightarrow b=3 \\end{cases}$\nبنابراین: $g(x) = 2x-1 \\Rightarrow g(2) = 3$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0558/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0558/stem_1.webp","sha256":"a4b99d63b212d06cf9aa5afec71d349bd65e29a435cce3fa7c128b22a129cb7a","bytes":9698}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":558,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0559","source_sha256":"d8d39ff507b1139d3535e6dd1d31d97af542c07abf21b440fdc74a77c4d40342","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار تابع $f$ در شکل زیر، اگر $f(f(a)) = 4$ باشد، مجموع مقادیر ممکن برای $a$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0559/stem_1.webp","alt":"شکل سؤال","aspect_ratio":1.1532}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$4$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-2$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-3$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار $f$ و $g$ ضابطهٔ آن‌ها را می‌نویسیم.\n$f(x) = -\\frac{x}{2} + 1 \\qquad g(x) = 2x+2$\nبنابراین:\n$fog(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}(2x+2)+1 = -x$\n$gof(x) = 2(-\\frac{x}{2}+1)+2 = -x+4$\nدر نتیجه:\n$fog(a-2) = gof(2-a) \\Rightarrow -a+2 = -(2-a)+4 \\Rightarrow 2a=0 \\Rightarrow a=0$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0559/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_0559/stem_1.webp","sha256":"964a225372cefdaafda51dcec9d5ed18ea30b5608d9877aaab47452f049bb6e2","bytes":33404}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":559,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0560","source_sha256":"81b1b3e16e30eb67276063a804382b64033416c85ee17e32c0a7cc70f9106ada","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f(x) = x + \\sqrt{x}$ و $g(x) = \\frac{x^2 - x}{x + \\sqrt{x}}$، مقدار $(f \\circ g)(\\sqrt{2})$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2} + 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\sqrt{2} - 1$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$2\\sqrt{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ضابطهٔ $fof$ را تشکیل داده و ساده می‌کنیم.\n$f(x) = |x-3|+3 \\Rightarrow fof(x)=f(f(x)) = |f(x)-3|+3$\n$= ||x-3|+3-3|+3 = |x-3|+3 = f(x)$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":560,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0561","source_sha256":"24661a91e896da8054beb4ce0353e852cd179a2ce07480576cd2e05502685cb0","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(-1, 2), (0, 3), (2, 4), (4, 5)\\}$ و $g = \\{(-2, 3), (3, 2), (4, -1), (5, 4)\\}$ باشند، حاصل $\\frac{f}{f \\circ g} (4)$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{5}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$-\\frac{3}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{5}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{3}{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار تابع خطی $f$ دارای شیب و عرض از مبدأ منفی است. بنابراین $a,b<0$ می‌باشند.\n$f(x)=ax+b \\Rightarrow fof(x)=f(f(x))=af(x)+b=a(ax+b)+b=a^2x+b(a+1)$\nبا توجه به نمودار تابع $fof$ دارای شیب مثبت و عرض از مبدأ منفی است.\nدر نتیجه:\n$\\begin{cases} a^2>0 \\Rightarrow \\text{بدیهی است.} \\\\ b(a+1)<0 \\xrightarrow{b<0} a+1>0 \\Rightarrow a>-1 \\end{cases}$\nبنابراین: $-1<a<0$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":561,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0562","source_sha256":"f0badcffe6239b58606e24e81cb7edcadf72338c864b44911f35db1ec3c2e6a5","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(1, 2), (2, 5), (3, 4), (4, 6)\\}$ و $g = \\{(2, 3), (4, 2), (5, 1), (3, 1)\\}$ باشند، برد تابع $g \\circ f$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{1, 3\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{1, 2\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{2, 3\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{1, 2, 3\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"نامعادلهٔ $fog(x)<0$ را حل می‌کنیم.\n$f(x)=2x-4 \\qquad g(x)=x^2-x$\n$fog(x)=2g(x)-4 = 2x^2-2x-4<0 \\Rightarrow x^2-x-2<0$\n$\\Rightarrow (x+1)(x-2)<0 \\Rightarrow -1<x<2 \\Rightarrow x \\in (-1,2)$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":562,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0563","source_sha256":"c26e8fd745de9c00b95094cd3c4c7c14cc2b11564de957c92bc8d9e7df553637","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f(x) = x + \\sqrt{x}$ و $g(x) = \\frac{1}{x^2 + x}$ باشند، حاصل $f(g(1))$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2} + 2}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2} + 1}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2} - 1}{2}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{2} - 2}{2}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"نامعادلهٔ $gof(x)>0$ را حل می‌کنیم.\n$f(x)=3x+1 \\qquad g(x)=-x^2-x+6$\n$gof(x)>0 \\Rightarrow g(f(x))>0 \\Rightarrow -f^2(x)-f(x)+6>0$\n$\\Rightarrow f^2(x)+f(x)-6<0 \\Rightarrow (f(x)+3)(f(x)-2)<0$\n$\\Rightarrow -3<f(x)<2$\n$-3<3x+1<2 \\Rightarrow -\\frac{4}{3}<x<\\frac{1}{3} \\Rightarrow x \\in (-\\frac{4}{3}, \\frac{1}{3})$\nبنابراین می‌توانستیم ابتدا $gof$ را برحسب $x$ به دست آورده، سپس نامعادله را حل کنیم."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":563,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0564","source_sha256":"738805243f59f25d3b382b2f5d6c6e645b8ca6cd217ba6959e7efb7b2d8e34a4","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(2, 1), (3, 2), (4, 5), (1, 4)\\}$ و $g = \\{(1, 3), (2, 4), (3, 1)\\}$ باشند، تابع $f \\circ g$ شامل کدام زوج مرتب است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$(2, 5)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(3, 4)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(3, 1)$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$(1, 3)$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: $f(x)=3x-1$ است، بنابراین $x = \\frac{f(x)+1}{3}$ می‌باشد.\n$gof(x) = g(f(x)) = 9(2x^2-x) = 9(2(\\frac{f+1}{3})^2-(\\frac{f+1}{3}))$\n$= 2(f+1)^2-3(f+1)=2f^2+f-1$\nبنابراین: $g(x)=2x^2+x-1$\nروش دوم: عددگذاری:\n$gof(x)=9(2x^2-x) \\xrightarrow{x=0} g(f(0)) = 0 \\Rightarrow g(-1)=0$\nاین رابطه فقط در 1 صدق می‌کند."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":564,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0565","source_sha256":"791c952346ccc527d2777b79158ae39d26f8e65eca52fbc650a81d1685a530cf","subject":"math","section_id":"math_functions_equations","source_topic_key":"functions","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر $f = \\{(0, 1), (2, 3), (3, 4), (5, 2)\\}$ و $g = \\{(2, 0), (1, 3), (3, 5), (4, 2)\\}$ باشند، برد تابع $g \\circ f$ کدام است؟"}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{3, 2, 5\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{1, 3, 2\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{3, 5, 2, 0\\}$"}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\{1, 3, 2, 0\\}$"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"ابتدا ضابطهٔ $g(x)$ را به دست می‌آوریم.\n$\\begin{cases} f(x)=x^2+x-1 \\Rightarrow fog(x)=f(g(x))=g^2(x)+g(x)-1 \\\\ \\text{از طرفی}: fog(x)=x^2-5x+5 \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow g^2(x)+g(x)-1=x^2-5x+5$\n$\\Rightarrow (g(x)+\\frac{1}{2})^2 - \\frac{5}{4} = (x-\\frac{5}{2})^2 - \\frac{5}{4}$\n$\\Rightarrow g(x)+\\frac{1}{2} = \\pm (x-\\frac{5}{2})$\n$\\Rightarrow \\begin{cases} g(x)=x-3 \\Rightarrow (f-g)(x)=x^2+2 \\\\ g(x)=-x+2 \\Rightarrow (f-g)(x)=x^2+2x-3 \\end{cases}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":[],"media_evidence":[],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":565,"question_pdf":"7.pdf","question_page":32,"solution_page":0,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
